  + CLIENT_PHONES + any ad-hoc numbers typed in UI
- Email/Text Results bar appears in UI after a scan completes
- AI review result (pick, confidence, summary) included in both email and SMS
- New env vars: EMAIL_FROM, EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD, ALERT_EMAIL, CLIENT_EMAILS,
  TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID, TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN, TWILIO_FROM, ALERT_PHONE, CLIENT_PHONES

